meta {
  name: Request insight job
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/market/insights/jobs
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  ADMINISTRATOR only, every profile. Creates the job for the published snapshot (idempotent per snapshot, prompt version and model configuration) or requeues it when it failed. 202 with the job; the worker runs it in the background, poll GET /v1/api/insights.
  409 AWAITING_DATA before the first ETL publication; 503 INSIGHTS_DISABLED when undercontroll.ai.insights.provider=none.
}
